      "vision_reason": "This is a wooden Qur'anic writing board (allo) with leather-bound handle, used for Islamic religious education—a well-attested item among Hausa Muslim communities in Niger/Nigeria for teaching Qur'anic recitation and writing. It is a genuine ritual/religious object, though not a mask; category should be corrected.",
